<rss version="2.0" xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/"><channel><title>纽约时报 &amp;gt; 美国 &amp;gt; 政治</title><link>https://www.nytimes.com/spotlight/on-politics</link><description></description><lastBuildDate>Thu, 19 Nov 2026 23:45:20 GMT</lastBuildDate><generator>rfeed v1.1.1</generator><docs>https://github.com/svpino/rfeed/blob/master/README.md</docs><item><title>埃隆·马斯克放弃让 MAGA 和他塑造的特朗普总统职位</title><link>https://www.nytimes.com/2026/11/19/us/politics/elon-musk-maga-trump.html</link><description>这位帮助特朗普在 2024 年当选总统并领导 DOGE 的人正在试图改写历史。</description><pubDate>Thu, 19 Nov 2026 23:45:20 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://www.nytimes.com/2026/11/19/us/politics/elon-musk-maga-trump.html</guid></item><item><title>皮特·布蒂吉格 (Pete Buttigieg) 在 2026 年中期选举中的赌注对 2028 年意味着什么</title><link>https://www.nytimes.com/2026/11/16/us/politics/pete-buttigieg-2028.html</link><description>他不再是一个新鲜面孔，他认为他的政党需要温和的红州耳语者。</description><pubDate>Tue, 17 Nov 2026 02:03:06 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://www.nytimes.com/2026/11/16/us/politics/pete-buttigieg-2028.html</guid></item><item><title>2026 年对 2028 年地图意味着什么？</title><link>https://www.nytimes.com/2026/11/12/us/politics/midterm-elections-2028-presidential-map.html</link><description>密西西比州和其他州对红色州到底是什么造成了新的不确定性。</description><pubDate>Thu, 12 Nov 2026 23:14:35 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://www.nytimes.com/2026/11/12/us/politics/midterm-elections-2028-presidential-map.html</guid></item><item><title>民主党与特朗普的斗争才刚刚开始</title><link>https://www.nytimes.com/2026/11/09/us/politics/democrats-trump-impeachment-corruption.html</link><description>该党正在讨论如何以及以多大的力度来反击，因为它已经掌握了权力。</description><pubDate>Mon, 09 Nov 2026 23:37:33 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://www.nytimes.com/2026/11/09/us/politics/democrats-trump-impeachment-corruption.html</guid></item><item><title>民主党接管德克萨斯州。现在怎么办？</title><link>https://www.nytimes.com/2026/11/06/us/politics/texas-democrats-takeover-what-now.html</link><description>民主党在孤星州的胜利超出了他们最疯狂的梦想。</description><pubDate>Fri, 06 Nov 2026 23:27:20 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://www.nytimes.com/2026/11/06/us/politics/texas-democrats-takeover-what-now.html</guid></item><item><title>这五场中期选举讲述了民主党蓝色浪潮的故事</title><link>https://www.nytimes.com/2026/11/05/us/politics/democrats-blue-wave-elections-districts.html</link><description>这些选区差异很大，但它们都解释了民主党如何赢得如此大的胜利。</description><pubDate>Fri, 06 Nov 2026 00:03:36 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://www.nytimes.com/2026/11/05/us/politics/democrats-blue-wave-elections-districts.html</guid></item><item><title>民主党大肆打击蓝色巨人</title><link>https://www.nytimes.com/2026/11/04/us/politics/democrats-deliver-a-big-blue-bludgeoning.html</link><description>该党的中期胜利重塑了政治格局。</description><pubDate>Wed, 04 Nov 2026 12:52:35 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://www.nytimes.com/2026/11/04/us/politics/democrats-deliver-a-big-blue-bludgeoning.html</guid></item><item><title></title><link>https://www.nytimes.com/2026/11/03/us/politics/the-on-politics-guide-to-election-night.html</link><description>根据我们的记者和编辑的说法，如何观看今晚的结果。</description><pubDate>Tue, 03 Nov 2026 23:31:46 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://www.nytimes.com/2026/11/03/us/politics/the-on-politics-guide-to-election-night.html</guid></item><item><title>民主党人进入选举日对中期选举充满希望</title><link>https://www.nytimes.com/2026/11/02/us/politics/democrats-election-day-midterms.html</link><description>查克·舒默认为他的政党已经扩大了版图。</description><pubDate>Tue, 03 Nov 2026 02:54:58 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://www.nytimes.com/2026/11/02/us/politics/democrats-election-day-midterms.html</guid></item><item><title>为什么竞选美国参议员是富人的游戏</title><link>https://www.nytimes.com/2026/10/30/us/politics/us-senate-races-millionaires-wealth.html</link><description>你的参议院候选人可能比你更有钱。</description><pubDate>Fri, 30 Oct 2026 22:58:45 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://www.nytimes.com/2026/10/30/us/politics/us-senate-races-millionaires-wealth.html</guid></item>